## Context

Surfaced during raid 2026-05-13 (PR #189). The CI pipeline runs only guard
scripts (validate-tickets, skill-lint, agnostic-guard, status-verb-guard,
pipefail-guard). `pytest tests/` is not invoked. PR #189 passed CI green
while the actual test suite (217 tests) was only confirmed locally.

This means a PR can break the test suite and merge undetected if the author
forgets to run pytest manually.

## Actions

1. Locate the CI config (`.github/workflows/` or equivalent).
2. Add a `pytest tests/` step after the existing guard steps.
3. Ensure the step fails the pipeline on any test failure.
4. Confirm on a test PR that a deliberate test failure blocks merge.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] `pytest tests/` runs in CI on every PR
- [ ] A failing test blocks merge (CI check goes red)
- [ ] All 217 existing tests pass in CI
